112
00:09:27,178 --> 00:09:30,765
What shall we do tonight? Shall we go out somewhere?

113
00:09:30,775 --> 00:09:32,641
No, I'm tired.

114
00:09:32,651 --> 00:09:34,838
I've had a really hard day.

115
00:09:34,848 --> 00:09:43,358
That's a bit boring. Come on, let's go to a cinema or see that new play at the theatre. Not tonight.

116
00:09:43,368 --> 00:09:46,010
Why don't we rent a video and stay in?

117
00:09:46,020 --> 00:09:51,062
Well, I'd rather go out. But if you're tired, OK.

118
00:09:51,072 --> 00:09:55,190
So what shall we have? How about that new Italian film?

119
00:09:55,200 --> 00:10:00,630
Oh no, far too serious for me. I'd fall asleep.

120
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:06,010
Why can't we get something funny? A film with Rick Moranis or someone like that.

121
00:10:06,020 --> 00:10:08,362
A comedy? No thanks.

122
00:10:08,372 --> 00:10:17,370
I'm not wasting my money. Well, I'll pay if you're going to be difficult about it. I'm not being difficult. I just don't want to see a comedy.

123
00:10:17,380 --> 00:10:17,480
Fine.

124
00:10:19,700 --> 00:10:21,870
What else do you suggest then?

125
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:27,030
How about a Robert De Niro? We've seen them all. Maybe, but they're great films.

126
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:28,110
Let's watch one again.

127
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:32,030
Now you're suggesting something that's a real waste of money.

128
00:10:32,040 --> 00:10:34,810
And I hate seeing films twice, you know that.

129
00:10:34,820 --> 00:10:37,245
OK, OK. What then?

130
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:40,685
I'm going to agree anyway.

131
00:10:40,695 --> 00:10:51,390
No, I tell you what. You go down to the video shop and choose a film. Whatever it is, I'll watch it. Really?

132
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:54,569
And you won't be difficult or make me feel guilty? No.

133
00:10:54,579 --> 00:11:00,422
Go on, off you go. I'll make something to eat while you're out. Great.

134
00:11:00,432 --> 00:11:03,034
See you in a few minutes then.

135
00:11:03,044 --> 00:11:03,160
Bye.

