148
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:51,548
It did rain a bit last year, but most of the time it was sunny.

149
00:12:51,558 --> 00:12:57,710
Anyway, it's not good walking in the heat. You have to stop all the time to rest and have drinks.

150
00:12:57,720 --> 00:13:00,590
Well, I like the sun.

151
00:13:00,600 --> 00:13:04,351
And I like to stay in comfortable hotels, not youth hostels.

152
